cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "coded-msprs: turbo-equalized rate-2 Multi-Stream Partial Response Signaling"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Al-Nafisah
    given-names: Abdullah
    affiliation: "King Abdullah University of Science and Technology"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/AbdullahAlNafisah/coded-msprs"
abstract: >-
  C++ simulation chain for turbo-equalized rate-2 Multi-Stream Partial Response
  Signaling (MS-PRS) built on AFF3CT, together with the simulated bit-error-rate
  and EXIT-characteristic caches it produced and the scripts that render them.
keywords:
  - turbo equalization
  - partial response signaling
  - faster-than-Nyquist signaling
  - EXIT charts
  - BCJR algorithm
  - LDPC codes
